        <dc:title>Handful of Leaves: An Anthology from the Sutta Piṭaka</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Bhikkhu, Ṭhānissaro" opf:role="aut">Ṭhānissaro Bhikkhu</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (4.9.1) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2015-12-29T08:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>This is a five-volume anthology of suttas (discourses) drawn from the Sutta Piṭaka (Discourse Basket or Repository) of the Pali Canon. The volumes correspond to the five collections comprising the Sutta Piṭaka: the Dīgha Nikāya (Long Collection), the Majjhima Nikāya (Middle Collection), Saṁyutta Nikāya (Connected Collection), Aṅguttara Nikāya (Numerical Collection), and Khuddaka Nikāya (Short Collection).</dc:description>
